{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\n\ndef sort_matrix(matrix: List[List[Union[int, float]]]) -> List[List[Union[int, float]]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sorts a given matrix in ascending order according to the sum of its rows.\n    Rows with equal sums maintain their original relative order (stable sort).\n    \"\"\"\n    rows_with_metadata = []\n    for original_index, row in enumerate(matrix):\n        row_sum = sum(row)\n        rows_with_metadata.append((row_sum, original_index, row))\n\n    sorted_rows_with_metadata = sorted(rows_with_metadata, key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1]))\n\n    sorted_matrix_result = [item[2] for item in sorted_rows_with_metadata]\n\n    return sorted_matrix_result"}
