{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(left, right):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of tuple elements in two given nested tuples.\n    Assumes inputs are valid tuples of tuples with matching lengths and integer elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_outer_tuple = []\n    for inner_left, inner_right in zip(left, right):\n        current_inner_result = []\n        for val_left, val_right in zip(inner_left, inner_right):\n            current_inner_result.append(int(val_left) * int(val_right))\n        result_outer_tuple.append(tuple(current_inner_result))\n    return tuple(result_outer_tuple)"}
