{"task_id": "Mbpp/598", "solution": "def armstrong_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given number is an Armstrong number.\"\"\"\n\n    def _digits(number: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Helper to extract digits from the absolute value of a number.\"\"\"\n        number = abs(number)\n        if number == 0:\n            return [0]\n        ds = []\n        while number > 0:\n            ds.append(number % 10)\n            number //= 10\n        return list(reversed(ds))\n\n    def _pow_sum(digit_list: list[int], power: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper to calculate the sum of digits raised to a given power.\"\"\"\n        return sum(d ** power for d in digit_list)\n\n    if n < 0:\n        return False\n\n    abs_n = abs(n)\n    digits_list = _digits(abs_n)\n    p = len(digits_list)\n    total = _pow_sum(digits_list, p)\n\n    return total == abs_n"}
