{"task_id": "Mbpp/724", "solution": "def power_base_sum(base: int, power: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates base to the specified power and returns the sum of its digits.\n    This implementation directly computes the power and then sums its digits as per the design context's utility functions.\n    \"\"\"\n    value = pow(base, power)\n    digit_sum = 0\n    # Handle the case where value is 0 separately\n    if value == 0:\n        return 0\n    while value > 0:\n        digit_sum += value % 10\n        value //= 10\n    return digit_sum"}
